summary:
  Six blank title polls pin a station as "no titles" and nothing lifts the
  pin again, so a station that was between songs at its first polls shows
  no title for the whole play.

history:
  This is the shape behind issue #10 ("Now Playing does not update track
  info unless you pick another station"), open since 2026-08-08. The pin
  is right for a server that carries no ICY metadata at all, and it was
  applied just the same to a server that answered six polls with an empty
  StreamTitle — an ad break, a jingle, a talk segment. From 2026-09-06 the
  pin arms a five-minute recheck that lifts it for a short burst of polls;
  a station still blank pins itself again. This mutant forgets to arm it.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
                      fastRetryTimer.stop();
                      noIcyRecheck.restart();

replace:
                      fastRetryTimer.stop();
                      fastRetryTimer.stop();

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_no_titles_pin_arms_its_own_recheck.
  Line-neutral, as main.qml's ratchet requires.
